                    <div class="col-lg-7 axil-post-wrapper">
                        <div class="post-heading">
                            <h2 class="title">
                                Surprise Your Friend with a Digital Gift Card!
                            </h2>
                            <div class="axil-post-meta">
                                <div class="post-author-avatar">
                                    <img src="~/assets/images/profile/profileImg.png" alt="Author Images">
                                </div>
                                <div class="post-meta-content">
                                    <h6 class="author-title">
                                        <a href="#">Admin</a>
                                    </h6>
                                    <ul class="post-meta-list">
                                        <li>Mar 20, 2022</li>
                                        @* <li>300k Views</li> *@
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p>

                            In a world where connections matter more than ever, giving the perfect gift has never been easier—or more meaningful. Digital gift cards have quickly become the go-to choice for thoughtful, instant gifting. Whether it’s a birthday, celebration, or a simple "thinking of you," sending a digital gift card can brighten someone’s day in just a few clicks.


                        </p>

                        <p>
                            At Semicolon, we believe that gifting should be simple, heartfelt, and accessible. That’s why we’ve made it easier than ever to send and receive digital gift cards, offering a wide variety of options for every taste and budget. From gaming credits to online store vouchers, your friends and loved ones will always find something they love.

                        </p>

                        <p>
                            <h5>Why Digital Gift Cards?</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>
                                    Instant Delivery: Perfect for last-minute surprises or long-distance gifts.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    Flexible Choice: Let your friend choose what they really want.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    Affordable and Convenient: Easily send value from your wallet without the hassle of physical wrapping or shipping.
                                </li>
                            </ul>


                        </p>


